---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import SchoolPicture from '../../components/SchoolPicture.astro';
import {lessons} from '../../data/money-school.mjs';
import '../../styles/money-school.css';
---
<Base title="Money School — five small lessons for beginners" description="Start from the very beginning with five free illustrated money lessons. Learn about money, needs and wants, budgets, saving and interest, with one quick question in each lesson.">
<div class="school hl-wrap">
 <header class="school-hero"><div><p class="school-eyebrow">HOWLOOP MONEY SCHOOL · START HERE</p><h1>Big money ideas.<br/><em>Small, simple steps.</em></h1><p class="school-lead">Never learned the basics? You’re in the right place. Five picture-led lessons, everyday examples and one little question at a time.</p><a class="school-button" href="/money-school/what-is-money/">Start lesson 1 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><p class="school-meta">Free · 3–4 minutes each · No account</p></div><div class="school-hero-art"><SchoolPicture scene="budget" description="Three illustrated jars divide ten dollars into five to spend, four to save and one to share."/><p>A small plan can be a great beginning.</p></div></header>
 <section aria-labelledby="school-path"><div class="school-section-title"><div><p class="school-eyebrow">YOUR FIRST FIVE</p><h2 id="school-path">One idea at a time.</h2></div><p>Follow the path, or choose a question.</p></div><ol class="school-path">{lessons.map((lesson,i)=><li><a class="school-card" href={`/money-school/${lesson.slug}/`}><div class="school-card-art"><SchoolPicture scene={lesson.scene} description={lesson.caption}/></div><div class="school-card-copy"><span class="school-eyebrow">LESSON {i+1} · {lesson.minutes} MIN</span><h3>{lesson.title}</h3><p>{lesson.short}</p></div><span class="school-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></li>)}</ol></section>
 <aside class="school-note"><h2>For first-timers of any age.</h2><p>Written in simple English, with examples a child can talk through with a grown-up. You only need addition, subtraction and curiosity. All amounts are made-up Australian-dollar examples; no real account or spending is needed.</p><p>Original stories and illustrations by Howloop. Lessons include sources and explanations for every answer. These are introductory lessons, not a complete curriculum or personal financial advice.</p><a href="/learn/">Already know the basics? Explore our money guides →</a></aside>
</div>
</Base>
